<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Beyond Log Likelihood: Probability-Based Objectives for Supervised Fine-Tuning across the Model Capability Continuum</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
