<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We now provide details of our experimental setup, including the rationale for the choice of datasets across the continuum, the corresponding training and evaluation benchmarks, and specific training protocols. An overview is summarized in Tab. <a href="#A2.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ Appendix B Detailed Experimental Setup ‣ Beyond Log Likelihood: Probability-Based Objectives for Supervised Fine-Tuning across the Model Capability Continuum" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<section id="A2.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.1 </span>Continuum Selection</h3>

<figure id="A2.T6" class="ltx_table">
